    'AdaptiveBehavior with quality-dependent sync intervals (30s/1min/5min/never), batch sizes (50/20/5/0), '
    'and compression levels. The OfflineAwareRepository mixin implements the offline-first pattern: online '
    'operations execute remotely and cache locally; offline operations queue mutations and return local data.',
